---
title: Apple Crisp Syrup
image: https://milkandpop.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/apple-brown-sugar-syrup-3-720x720.jpg
---

In a #small pot{}, add @water{3/4%cup}, @dark brown sugar{1/2%cup}, @unsulphured molasses{1%tbsp}(can replace with 3/4 tbsp brown sugar), @cinnamon{1/2%tsp}, @tart apple peels{2}. Cook over medium-high heat until bubbling and reduce down by half.

Heat until the syrup mixture is slightly viscous, but not thick like syrup.

Let cool, remove the apple peel, and store in the refrigerator for up to 2 weeks.